  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 2602.01 Applicant",
  "priorExpiration": "2000-03-31",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2602.01 \"Applicant\" means any person who wishes to apply for a license to market or sell display fireworks, consumer fireworks or permissible fireworks.\n\nSource. #4983, eff 11-16-90; ss and moved by #5752, eff 12-2-93 (see Saf-C 2607); ss by INTERIM #7140, eff 12-2-99, EXPIRED: 3-31-00\n\nNew. #7905, eff 6-24-03; ss by #8519, eff 12-16-05; ss by #10784, eff 2-13-15",
